[center]=== Welcome! ===

I'm a CS student @ UWaterloo looking to make really neat things with computers. Some of my interests include biking, neural networks, audio engineering, automation, culinary experimentation and pseudo-philosophy.
In the past I've worked for PathAI in Boston, Shopify in Toronto, and various other companies in the Waterloo region.

If you're not on mobile, you can edit this page! Press i to enter INSERT mode, and press escape to leave it. Press v to enter VISUAL mode, to select.

Click the selection box at the top of the screen to view my portfolio. I also have a few written works for your entertainment in the writings tab.

Made in React/Next.js.